# Allowlist the build context: local data, OCI keys, Android keys and git never enter it.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!server/
!server/**
!web/
!web/**
!scripts/
!scripts/container-entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.hash
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
